---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | ailegalguard.com';
const description =
  'How ailegalguard.com collects, stores and protects inquiry data — including what is kept in Cloudflare Workers KV, how long it is retained, and your options.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-20 pt-32 sm:pt-36">
    <div class="mb-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-white/5 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-medium tracking-[1.5px] text-white/60">
      LEGAL
    </div>
    <h1 class="section-header tracking-[-0.035em]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-white/45">Last updated {SITE.updated}</p>

    <div class="article-body mt-9">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information this website collects, why it is collected, where it
        is stored, and what you can ask us to do about it. It applies only to this website and the
        inquiry forms on it.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Two categories of information are handled here:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Inquiry and offer details</strong> — the name, email address, organization,
          offered amount, preferred timeline and message you choose to submit through the inquiry
          form.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Newsletter / resource requests</strong> — the email address you enter to request
          the buyer's checklist.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Basic request metadata</strong> — the timestamp, approximate country, referring
          page, and a truncated user agent string attached automatically by the hosting platform.
          We do not use this to build profiles.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No payment card details. Payments for a domain are handled by an escrow provider, not by this site.</li>
        <li>No account registration, passwords, or stored credentials.</li>
        <li>No advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.</li>
        <li>We do not buy, enrich, or append data from third-party brokers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How submissions are stored</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are sent to a serverless endpoint on this site and stored in
        <strong>Cloudflare Workers KV</strong> on Cloudflare's edge network. Records are retained
        for up to <strong>365 days</strong> and then automatically deleted, unless a longer period
        is required to complete a transaction you started or to meet a legal obligation.
      </p>
      <p>
        The form is protected by a honeypot field, a minimum time-to-submit check, and per-address
        rate limiting. These exist to stop automated abuse; they are not used to profile visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiry, offer, or request — and only for that purpose.</li>
        <li>To negotiate and complete a domain transaction if you choose to proceed.</li>
        <li>To send the resource you specifically asked for.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not sell, rent, trade, or share your information with advertisers.</strong>
        We do not add you to a marketing list because you submitted an inquiry.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong>, a privacy-oriented, cookie-free
        measurement tool operated by Cloudflare. It does not use cookies and does not track you
        across other websites.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Pages may link to external services such as escrow providers or registries. Those sites
        operate under their own privacy policies, which we do not control.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live, you may have the right to request access to, correction of, or
        deletion of the personal information we hold about you, and to object to or restrict its
        use. To exercise any of those rights, email us — see below. We will respond within a
        reasonable period and in any case within 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served exclusively over HTTPS with HTTP→HTTPS enforcement and HSTS. Access to
        stored records requires authenticated Cloudflare account credentials. No transmission
        method over the internet is completely secure, but we do not collect more than we need.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This site is directed at professional buyers and is not intended for children under 16. We
        do not knowingly collect information from them.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this page to reflect changes in how the site works. The "last updated" date
        at the top of this page always reflects the current version.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your data:
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.acquisitionEmail}`}>{SITE.acquisitionEmail}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="/" class="tap rounded-2xl bg-white px-7 font-semibold text-[#0a0a0f] no-underline transition hover:bg-white/90">
        Back to the domain
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/" class="tap rounded-2xl border border-white/20 px-7 font-semibold text-white/80 no-underline transition hover:border-white/45">
        Read the guides
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
